---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import AssetImage from "@/components/AssetImage.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy | Global Enterprise" description="Global Enterprise privacy notice." noindex keywords={["Global Enterprise privacy", "consulting website privacy notice", "data handling"]}><section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-start"><div><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 class="section-title mt-7">A straightforward approach to privacy.</h1><p class="body-copy mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl">We keep the information we collect proportionate to the conversation we are having.</p></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cobalt"><AssetImage src="/media/generated/enterprise-hero.avif" width={1536} height={1024} loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="A quiet enterprise strategy room prepared for a working session" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover opacity-90" /></div></div></section><section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site max-w-3xl"><div class="prose max-w-none text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:tracking-[-0.06em] prose-headings:text-ink prose-h2:mt-12 prose-h2:text-4xl"><p>Global Enterprise collects only the information needed to respond to inquiries, send requested perspectives, and operate this website. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Contact forms</h2><p>If you contact us, we use the details you provide to respond to your request. We retain correspondence only as long as needed for that purpose or to meet legal obligations.</p><h2>The Signal</h2><p>If you subscribe to The Signal, we use your email address to send occasional notes from Global Enterprise. Each note includes an unsubscribe path, and we remove subscription details when you ask us to.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>This site uses Plausible Analytics, a privacy-focused service that does not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking. We measure aggregate page views and events such as form starts and CTA clicks to improve the experience.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:info@globalenterprise.com">info@globalenterprise.com</a>.</p></div></div></section></Base>
